      "name": "Saad Asif",
      "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:03:07.934Z",
      "cooked": "<p>the <strong>archived folder</strong> is simply where bench moves older versions of apps whenever you update or remove them… instead of deleting the old app folders permanently, bench stores them here as a backup so you can review, compare, or restore the previous code if something goes wrong after an update, these archived copies aren’t used by the system anymore they’re just kept for safety and can be deleted if you no longer need them</p>",
