    {
      "id": 488154,
      "username": "shaileshsaini",
      "name": "Shailesh",
      "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:18:21.695Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The <strong>archived</strong> folder is where Bench stores older versions of apps whenever you update or remove them. Instead of permanently deleting the previous app folders, Bench keeps them here as a backup. These archived copies are not used by the system anymore—they simply exist for reference, comparison, or restoration in case something breaks after an update. You can safely delete them if you no longer need these backups.</p>",
